{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stellar Rhythm is a high-energy, experimental side-scrolling space shooter where sound and vision collide. Every element of the game is fused to the music: your ship\u2019s weapons fire with the rhythm, enemies attack in perfect sync, and vibrant, shifting settings warp and pulse to the beat. Even your supermoves don\u2019t just unleash destruction - they remix the soundtrack in real time, turning the battlefield into a living, breathing instrument.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/043c87be01684cb4a0c7484cd7d9e9fc.poster.avif?t=1759244362\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/043c87be01684cb4a0c7484cd7d9e9fc.webm?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/043c87be01684cb4a0c7484cd7d9e9fc.mp4?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Designed for maximum immersion, Stellar Rhythm runs fluidly at 120fps, wrapping players in a kaleidoscope of color, rhythm, and explosive action. With multiple game modes, deep progression, and unlockable upgrades, every run is a fresh, pulse-pounding journey through light and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.poster.avif?t=1759244362\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.webm?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.mp4?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Created entirely by a solo developer - award-winning DJ and music producer Azido 88 - Stellar Rhythm brings decades of underground music culture and energy into a unique, experimental gameplay experience. It\u2019s not just a shooter, and not just a rhythm game: it\u2019s a trippy audiovisual ride that pushes both genres into new territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.poster.avif?t=1759244362\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.webm?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.mp4?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The soundtrack fuels the experience with a globe-spanning mix of underground sound: from raw drum &amp; bass and breakbeat to hard-hitting electro, hypnotic house, thunderous dubstep, bass-heavy hip-hop, and laid-back lofi beats. Every track fuels a seamless fusion of music and gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055760?t=1759244362","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/1bf52d4492ff001dc7c92f807385a55ee936c4a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759244362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/bb5e4dd9bc144e5025ec637b828607d7482e10c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759244362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/bb5e4dd9bc144e5025ec637b828607d7482e10c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759244362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stellar Rhythm is a high-energy, experimental side-scrolling space shooter where sound and vision collide. Every element of the game is fused to the music: your ship\u2019s weapons fire with the rhythm, enemies attack in perfect sync, and vibrant, shifting settings warp and pulse to the beat. Even your supermoves don\u2019t just unleash destruction - they remix the soundtrack in real time, turning the battlefield into a living, breathing instrument.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/043c87be01684cb4a0c7484cd7d9e9fc.poster.avif?t=1759244362\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/043c87be01684cb4a0c7484cd7d9e9fc.webm?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/043c87be01684cb4a0c7484cd7d9e9fc.mp4?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Designed for maximum immersion, Stellar Rhythm runs fluidly at 120fps, wrapping players in a kaleidoscope of color, rhythm, and explosive action. With multiple game modes, deep progression, and unlockable upgrades, every run is a fresh, pulse-pounding journey through light and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.poster.avif?t=1759244362\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.webm?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.mp4?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Created entirely by a solo developer - award-winning DJ and music producer Azido 88 - Stellar Rhythm brings decades of underground music culture and energy into a unique, experimental gameplay experience. It\u2019s not just a shooter, and not just a rhythm game: it\u2019s a trippy audiovisual ride that pushes both genres into new territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.poster.avif?t=1759244362\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.webm?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.mp4?t=1759244362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The soundtrack fuels the experience with a globe-spanning mix of underground sound: from raw drum &amp; bass and breakbeat to hard-hitting electro, hypnotic house, thunderous dubstep, bass-heavy hip-hop, and laid-back lofi beats. Every track fuels a seamless fusion of music and gameplay.</p>","developers":[" Azido Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3280990","name":"Stellar Rhythm"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055760/985718dda2c07b6084183633fa424a959c3800be/header.jpg?t=1759244362","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4055760/363842388/5b74727fc8be707664c092fc63e6cbd54bf4acdb/1759243815/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759244359","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4055760/363842388/5b74727fc8be707664c092fc63e6cbd54bf4acdb/1759243815/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759244359","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4055760/363842388/5b74727fc8be707664c092fc63e6cbd54bf4acdb/1759243815/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759244359","id":257209350,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209350/movie480.mp4?t=1759244359","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209350/movie_max.mp4?t=1759244359"},"name":"Stellar Rhythm Demo Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209350/34b9ae47af989ad0531ff876d5d67f6f7c2e5d3b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759244359","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209350/movie480.webm?t=1759244359","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209350/movie_max.webm?t=1759244359"}}],"name":"Stellar Rhythm Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3.0 G